#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:5
#: affb9d284e604f929d05df5ffc908380
msgid "Calibration: Accelerometer Calibration"
msgstr "校准：加速度计校准"

#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:7
#: 36ddc981bbaa44908f80d2c7ab965812
msgid ""
"This article explains how to calibrate your autopilot's accelerometer to "
"work with your vehicle configuration. For other calibration tasks see "
":ref:`Autopilot calibration <autopilot-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何校准飞控的加速度计，以适配您的飞行器配置。有关其他校准任务，请参阅 :ref:`飞控校准 <autopilot-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:12
#: c6072a60536446f597b2bde8292a7151
msgid "1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "1 前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:14
#: 86d1ba8cd2ba4ad289b809a08a22c19b
msgid "Before performing setup, ensure that:"
msgstr "在执行设置之前，请确保："

#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:16
#: f376472e499c4cb2b9d0ba1c61805d21
msgid "The vehicle is completely built to flight condition."
msgstr "飞行器已完整组装至可飞行状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:17
#: 1e5bd2a4841f4d2c9d36a432806d237c
msgid ":ref:`Firmware has been loaded onto the autopilot. <install-firmware>`"
msgstr ":ref:`固件已加载到飞控中。 <install-firmware>`"

#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:18
#: e03fb2fbab19496fb7fced8ec3ecb67b
msgid ":ref:`Autopilot is connected to APM Planner. <connect-autopilot>`"
msgstr ":ref:`飞控已连接至 APM Planner。 <connect-autopilot>`"

#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:21
#: 743a193ca05d420d84806aa108073e1f
msgid "2 Accelerometer Calibration"
msgstr "2 加速度计校准"

#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:23
#: 7e039d81ac25420e88e8747dd1049347
msgid ""
"Select **Accel Calibration** to view the accelerometer calibration wizard. "
"Select **Calibrate Accelerometer** to begin. Follow the prompts and select "
"**Continue** after each step. It is important not to move the copter "
"immediately after pressing the key for each step."
msgstr ""
"选择「Accel Calibration」以打开加速度计校准向导。选择「Calibrate "
"Accelerometer」开始校准。按照提示操作，每步完成后选择「Continue」。每步按键后请勿立即移动飞行器，这一点非常重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/accelerometer-calibration.rst:31
#: 781922801cbf4cba95a9d65e35ce618e
msgid ""
"Check out this video for an example of how to hold your vehicle during "
"accelerometer calibration."
msgstr "观看此视频，了解在加速度计校准过程中如何握持飞行器的示例。"
